# Copy this file to local-hosts.txt (same folder) and list your devices.
# One "IP-address hostname" per line. Saving the file applies it, with no restart.
# Pi-hole then shows the name instead of the IP in its UI, and the name resolves on your LAN.
# Give each device a DHCP reservation in the eero app so its IP never changes.
#
# 192.168.1.26 laptop
# 192.168.1.63 phone
